{"synopsis":"Lanian, hadapi dunia sekali lagi!\nHanya sihirmu yang akan mengakhiri perang ini.\nSahabatku telah meninggal, dan guruku pun telah meninggal.\nPara penduduk desa kehilangan nyawa mereka tanpa alasan.\n\nPerang telah merenggut segalanya, tanpa meninggalkan apa pun.\nNamun hidup itu sendiri adalah sebuah petualangan.\nKau tidak bisa mengakhiri perang tanpa melangkah ke jantung pusarannya.\n\nLanian—nama yang lahir dari petualanganku, nama yang akan kupanggil hingga hari kematianku!","alternative_title":"바람의 마도사","author":"Kim Geun-Woo","artist":"Next Level Studio","chapters":[{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"537de20b-6161-4bc7-bec3-7fc1e16aa086","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-08-21"},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"b1cf6a01-f0d1-4915-ade2-3e4ea2ecd4be","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-08-15"},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"e0edd382-4616-49d5-bcca-594b170ed503","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-08-07"},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"ee6105fc-308e-4d57-b030-dcc428bf40b3","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"2a91211f-89b9-406e-b992-359fedfdffe0","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"e5b6d7d7-3bc4-4624-9343-73bd4d427f82","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"17","chapter":"17","slug":"a9a901c4-1c03-47a2-8032-649eb052f709","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"16","chapter":"16","slug":"3691e087-58fc-47aa-9880-c165c0bda5ae","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"787dc6f3-0048-4992-9faa-1d3aa504a848","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"64d1cd41-0343-48c6-b725-e3f8d958c86e","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"8d535eca-34f3-475d-be93-2f54368bccec","title":"Chapter 13","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"12","chapter":"12","slug":"51afcdce-0d9a-402a-9202-6f362f2d1704","title":"Chapter 12","date":"202